# Normalize text to LF in the repository; shell scripts and hooks must be LF to run on Linux
# (local-dev.md: Windows checkouts produce CRLF, which breaks `#!/bin/sh` scripts).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf

# Binary data the research engine and web app ship
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
